gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.0=§d§lJust replaced the structure of TST, the rest of the functions are consistent
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.1=§d§lYou only need to let the proton and antiproton beams pass quietly from both ends
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.2=§d§l Through the magnetic field into the containment sphere, easy and pleasant!
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.3=§7Its simple appearance is due to the elegance of the theory.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.4=§7The actual energy production is affected by three levels of blocks.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.5=§7At the same time, higher levels will increase the probability of recycling materials.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.6=§7Maintaining continuous operation will also increase energy output.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.7=§7Only one input bus is allowed and must be installed.
