gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.tooltip.9=§7Use a wire cutter to turn on/off the animation effects.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.structure.output_coefficient=§eOutput coefficient§7 = Time Field Level^§b0.25§7 * Space Field Level^§b0.25§7 * §b1.588186§7^(Stability Field Level - §b2§7)
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.structure.actual_output=§eActual output EU§7 = Recipe value * Output coefficient * Continuous operation bonus coefficient
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.structure.recovery_chance=§eMaterial recycling probability§7 = Time Field Level * Space Field Level * Stability Field Level / §b1000§7
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.structure.fuel_consumption=§7The input fuel will be consumed at once, then run for §b6.4s§7 (default), and output the corresponding EU value.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.structure.continuous_bonus=§7During continuous operation, each run increases the continuous operation bonus coefficient by §b1%§7.
gtnl.machine.real_artificial_star.structure.max_continuous_bonus=§7Maximum continuous operation bonus coefficient is §b150%§7, drops to §b100%§7 after interruption.
