gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.name=White Night Generator
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.recipe_type=§d§lViolet Baptism
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.0=§f§l§oRise, my servants, and sing to welcome my arrival.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.1=§rDeals damage to a large area of entities and generates power, entities that take damage too many times will be §cdirectly killed
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.2=§rIf a certain type of entity takes damage too many times, it will skip that entity!
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.3=§rEntities with health below a certain value will be §cdirectly killed
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.4=§7And the owner of the machine will take §c5 * number of entities killed §7magic damage and receive several debuffs
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.5=§7This machine has a §cQliphoth Counter§7, with a maximum of §a3§7, it decreases by one every time the machine runs, and will emit a redstone signal when maintenance is needed
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.6=§7The redstone signal strength will be interpreted as a §b4-bit binary number§7 from §a0§7 to §a15
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.7=§7The lowest bit is marked as bit 4, and the highest bit is bit 1
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.8=§eBit 1: §c§oDetected work instruction system failure
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.9=§7If this bit is §a1§7, the lowest bit is marked as bit 1, and the highest bit is bit 4
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.10=§7The output signal is not adjusted by bit 1!
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.11=§eBit 2: §6§oDetected Qliphoth energy collapse
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.12=§7If this bit is §a1§7, the corresponding suppression fluid should be input
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.13=§7To determine which fluid to insert, interpret bits 1 and 3 as a 2-bit binary number
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.14=§a0: 10000L Molten Neutron / 1: 7500L Molten Infinity / 2: 5000L Space-Time / 3: 2500L Magnetic Matter
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.15=§eBit 3: §7§oTick... Tock...
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.16=§7If this bit is §a1§7, §a5000000L§7 of purified water should be input
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.17=§7Using higher levels of purified water can increase the probability during judgment!
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.18=§eOutput multiplier: §aLevel 5: 2% / Level 6: 3% / Level 7: 4% / Level 8: 5%
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.19=§eBit 4: §c§oBlood mist spreads, corpses lie everywhere.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.20=§7If this bit is §a1§7, §a100000L§7 of blood and §a1§7 flawless core should be input
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.21=§eNo bit: §oPure self
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.22=§eTree of Light
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.23=§cMachine energy overload, requires 10000L of expanded space fluid
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.24=§cAfter maintenance failure, the check result will immediately become §c§oPoor!
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.25=§7After successful maintenance, §a35§7 probability checks will be performed, §oeach check interval is 2 seconds
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.26=§7If the number of checks cannot be completed during the current run, the remaining checks will immediately be negative
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.27=§7Base probability is §a45%§7, placing higher-level field generators in the host can increase the probability
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.28=§7§oAs the cumulative number of checks increases, the judgment time and probability will increase
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.29=§c§oEvery 5 entities killed will immediately reduce the Qliphoth Counter by 1
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.30=§c§oIf the machine runs without dealing damage to any entity, the Qliphoth Counter will immediately reduce by 1
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.31=§7Check result is §a§oExcellent (26~35)§7 will produce a large amount of power and fully heal the player and apply buffs, then increase the Qliphoth Counter by §a1
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.32=§7If §e§oGood (6~15)§7 it will produce less power and heal the player by §a5 HP§7, with a §a50%§7 chance to increase the Qliphoth Counter by 1
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.33=§7If §c§oPoor (0~15)§7 it will apply debuffs to the player, spawn several monsters, and shut down
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.34=§cEvery 10 maintenance will increase the Qliphoth Meltdown Level by 1§7, maximum level is §a10§7, each level reduces the success rate of probability checks by §c1%
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.35=§7Whenever the Qliphoth Meltdown Level increases, the machine will enter §cQliphoth Energy Meltdown State§7, requiring immediate maintenance, time limit §a1 minute
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.36=§7If no maintenance is performed during the §cQliphoth Energy Meltdown State§7, the Qliphoth Counter will immediately drop to §c0§7 after the countdown ends
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.37=§7As the Qliphoth Meltdown Level increases, it will generate §oDawn, Noon, Dusk, Midnight§7 trials
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.38=§7The types of trials include §aGreen§7, §6Amber§7, §dViolet§7, §cBlood§7, §9Indigo
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.39=§7If §cQliphoth Meltdown Level reaches 10§7, all trial types will become §oPale§7, difficulty and rewards will significantly increase
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.40=§7Completing trials will generate a portion of the machine's EU per second multiplied by the total time spent:
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.41=§eDawn: 10%
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.42=§eNoon: 15%
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.43=§eDusk: 20%
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.44=§eMidnight: 25%
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.45=§cWhen the Qliphoth Counter is 0, it will trigger a massive explosion causing 500 billion pollution
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.46=§cGenerates a large number of monsters, 11 Ender Dragons, and 1 Wither. Cannot be restarted until no Wither or Ender Dragons are detected within the range.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.47=§cPlayers within the range will receive 500 magic damage + 5000 physical damage.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.48=§7Generates §a2147483647 * Total damage dealt to all entities * Entity type * 500§7 EU per second during operation. Requires a Force Field Generator in the host to complete structure check.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.49=§7Fixed operation time of §a500 seconds§7.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.50=§0§o§mInstall the Final Spiral to ignore the above mechanisms.
gtnl.machine.white_night_generator.tooltip.51=§c§oNote: EU cache will be generated inside the machine during operation. Destruction will immediately cause an explosion!
